WEBVTT

00:03.440 --> 00:06.120
As for this marriage, it depends primarily on affinity and fate.

00:06.160 --> 00:13.000
Have that young lady Wan'er's eight characters delivered to the Ministry of Rites to divine if their stars align.

00:13.320 --> 00:15.100
Thank you, Your Majesty! Thank you, Imperial Father!

00:15.320 --> 00:17.500
Enough. Court is adjourned.

00:26.440 --> 00:35.880
(This marriage proposal was petitioned openly before the entire civil and military court. If it is finalized, it signals His Majesty's tacit approval for Ning to bind with the Chen clan.)

00:36.040 --> 00:41.720
(Once their momentum swells, all those waiting on the fence will gradually align themselves behind the Prince of Ning.)

00:41.880 --> 00:47.000
Your subject has also received intelligence: General Zu Kun from the northern frontier will soon arrive at court for his review.

00:47.360 --> 00:50.400
It is said their vanguard regiment has already pitched camp outside the capital suburbs.

00:50.560 --> 00:59.200
The Zu clan has always remained strictly neutral. If their allegiance is swayed in Ning's direction at this critical juncture, disaster looms!

00:59.440 --> 01:05.900
A marriage may seem a private affair, yet its political ramifications are immense. His Majesty ordering the Ministry of Rites to divine the dates means he too is hesitating.

01:06.360 --> 01:09.800
Your Highness, we must find a way to derail this marriage!

01:10.760 --> 01:11.600
I understand.

01:11.760 --> 01:15.800
This old subject shall sound out the other factions and see what else can be done.

01:22.880 --> 01:26.000
Imperial Mother, your son has arranged everything...

01:26.600 --> 01:29.200
Your son Sikong Yao pays his respectful greetings to Imperial Mother!

01:29.760 --> 01:34.200
Ah, Yao'er is here! Quick, summon Yao'er inside!

01:39.440 --> 01:42.000
Eldest Brother is here as well? Greetings, Eldest Brother.

01:43.480 --> 01:50.000
Look at you—how long has it been since you last visited Mother? Come, kowtow to Imperial Mother and beg her forgiveness!

01:50.000 --> 01:55.200
Mother, your son has lived outside the palace and failed to visit frequently. I pray Imperial Mother will forgive my negligence.

01:55.320 --> 02:00.000
Enough, enough! It gladdens my heart just to see you visit me today.

02:01.440 --> 02:09.000
Today is truly a blessed day—my Zheng'er and my Yao'er have both come to keep me company!

02:10.040 --> 02:15.500
Xiao Qing, bring out the box of fresh pastries I baked the other day.

02:19.600 --> 02:20.500
What is the matter?

02:21.240 --> 02:26.500
Reporting to the Empress: you previously bestowed those pastries as treats to the palace servants. Only a single pastry remains.

02:27.880 --> 02:33.000
Look at my failing memory! There's no time to bake another batch now.
